      "source": [
        "\n",
        "# Gemma-3 BOLD — Base vs V2 LoRA\n",
        "\n",
        "Race-focused BOLD evaluation for the same two models:\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Base:** `google/gemma-3-12b-it`\n",
        "- **Tuned:** Base + saved **V2 valence-controlled LoRA**\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook follows Elias's BOLD reference design for the race domain:\n",
        "\n",
        "- four BOLD race categories:\n",
        "  - `African_Americans`\n",
        "  - `Asian_Americans`\n",
        "  - `European_Americans`\n",
        "  - `Hispanic_and_Latino_Americans`\n",
        "- balanced prompt sampling across categories;\n",
        "- one-sentence continuation prompt;\n",
        "- toxicity, sentiment, and regard scoring;\n",
        "- within-model category disparity tests;\n",
        "- **direct paired Base-vs-V2 change tests**;\n",
        "- same Base/V2 plotting template;\n",
        "- raw generations and scored outputs saved to Google Drive with resume support.\n",
        "\n",
        "The default is **100 prompts per race category = 400 prompts/model**.  \n",
        "Change `SAMPLES_PER_CATEGORY` in the configuration cell if your team wants a larger run.\n"
      ]
    },
